	(descr "Fanstel BT840XE nRF52840 module with SKY66112 PA and u.FL, 15 x 28 x 1.9 mm. Pad positions from the BT840X/BT840XE mechanical drawing, Product Specifications Ver 1.26 p.12 (top view). Pad names are Fanstel's. Origin is the centre of the 15 x 28 mm outline. Fanstel gives no host land pattern here: castellated lands extend 0.5 mm past the module edge and are 0.70 mm wide. Check against the Fanstel library before fab. The upper section is the shield and u.FL, with no pads under it.")
